- Frontend: seven behavior tests pass; production Next15.5.19 build/typecheck passes on Windows. Sandbox path resolution required approved normal-host execution; no production access was escalated.
- Actual served Oracle GET-only contract gate: capability endpoint404; missing target_listing_id, OpportunityOut.last_seen_at, ListingOut.last_seen_at, ListingOut.thumbnail, Portal capability, deployment fingerprint. Runtime source detector independently rejects Portal.
- No production deployment. Deployment gates not satisfied: unresolved regression failures, PostgreSQL migration rehearsal, fresh backup and restore validation, exact image rollback readiness, resources and scraper-health baseline, and desktop acceptance are incomplete. Existing runtime is newer than parts of local checkout; build overlay on the exact current image only after reconciliation.
- Desktop validation blocked by computer-use tool: it could not determine current Chrome URL confidently to enforce policy. No retry or alternative browser-control workaround attempted.
- No commits: checkout already contained overlapping uncommitted V2/Portal/spatial work. Preserve attribution and review a task-scoped staging diff before commits. HEAD remains5288dde.
- Persistent continuation: resolve report primary wording (#9), secondary analyzer link (#12), saved-status race handling (#13), complete safe desktop scenarios (#21), investigate five broad-suite failures, rehearse0021 on isolated PostgreSQL, verify fresh backup/restore/rollback and current scrapers/resources, then deploy API-only overlay and run actual1130/298/Portal/period/image/account acceptance. Do not deploy the old full checkout.
'''
